      "expectedBehavior": "Only while active in the Confrontation Zone, Gigabonblade may target its own occurrence and reduce its current power by exactly 2 as an activation cost. Insufficient power, another target, another zone, or inactive text rejects without mutation. On resolution it gains Persist only until the end of that turn; after a win it remains in the Confrontation Zone and becomes its controller's next First Manifestation.",
