      "name": "Gigabonblade",
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "printedParagraph": "If Gigabonblade would leave the Confrontation Zone due to cards or effects, exile it instead. If it is exiled this way, all Manifestations currently on the field get -2 power.",
